==Trivia==
*Baby Gao appears in [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle &amp; Dragon]] as a hat for the unlockable Basic Cat unit.
*Mighty Lord Gao, by his design, may be a reference to a [[wikipedia:Kitsune|Kitsune Wolf]].
*Baby Gao was formerly the only fest unit available in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]] until the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Update History#Live Download Patch (September 14, 2023)|September 14, 2023 Live Download Patch]] added [[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow Gao]].
*Mighty Lord Gao is one of the units to have his description rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "immune to Wave attacks" was changed to "Immune to Waves".
*As of [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Baby Gao is the only [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|Superfest]] exclusive with a [[Cat Combo]]

